Chapter 4 saRNA screening dataset
  Files:    src/sarna/validation/data/vondervoort_2026_chapter4.csv
            src/sarna/validation/data/vondervoort_2026_chapter4_coordinates.csv
  Source:   J. Vondervoort, "Evaluating saRNA-Mediated Promoter Activation Beyond
            SCN1A", doctoral thesis, chapter 4. Publicly defended thesis.
  Licence:  Copyright 2026 Joep Vondervoort, redistributed here under the
            Apache-2.0 licence above as part of this package.
  Note:     125 assayed target sequences, 14 of which activated their gene, plus
            recovered GRCh38 coordinates for 123 of them. This is the only data
            in the package that can show a design rule to be wrong rather than
            merely unconventional. It is range-restricted: every sequence was
            built to pass Wang's gate, so it can show a gate too strict but not
            one too permissive. See CHAPTER4_CAVEATS in
            src/sarna/validation/dataset.py.

