================================================================================
External services used at runtime (not redistributed)
================================================================================

These are queried over the network when you use the tool. No data from them is
bundled in this package; cached responses are stored locally on your machine.

  Ensembl REST API  -- https://rest.ensembl.org/
    Gene, transcript and genomic sequence retrieval (human, GRCh38).
    Ensembl data are available without restriction; see
    https://www.ensembl.org/info/about/legal/disclaimer.html
    Please cite Ensembl in publications that rely on its annotation.

  NCBI BLAST URL API -- https://blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/
    Optional, opt-in off-target screening. Queries are 19 nt sequences drawn
    from the public human genome; running a search tells NCBI which gene you
    are working on. NCBI usage policy limits request rates and asks that large
    jobs run outside US business hours.

Datasets that an optional adapter can read from your own disk (AF22 histone
tracks, and any future local track source) are not redistributed here and keep
whatever terms you obtained them under.
